    <item>
      <title>对特朗普有关伊朗战争对油价、弹药等影响的说法进行事实核查</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/trump-iran-war-toll-oil-fact-check.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总统误导性地将当前对弹药库存的担忧以及有关伊朗战争的其他说法归咎于拜登政府向乌克兰转让武器。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/trump-iran-war-toll-oil-fact-check.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:02:16 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>乌克兰如何通过 MAGA 和特朗普盟友劳拉·卢默 (Laura Loomer) 取得进展</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/ukraine-maga-loomer-trump.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[乌克兰及其支持者多年来一直致力于消除特朗普总统的 MAGA 运动和总统本人对该国战争努力的怀疑。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/ukraine-maga-loomer-trump.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:02:02 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>盟友担心美国在伊朗可能会遭受战略失败</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/us-iran-war-strategy.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于特朗普总统的目标均未实现，霍尔木兹海峡关闭，美国盟友看到了战争带来的功能障碍和脆弱性。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/us-iran-war-strategy.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:01:52 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普政府正在取消加强工作场所热防护的计划</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/climate/heat-workplace-protections-osha-trump.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[拜登政府采取措施保护工人免受极端气温的影响。特朗普政府正在对雇主采取更加温和的态度。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/climate/heat-workplace-protections-osha-trump.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:01:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>她投票给了推翻罗伊的法官。现在它在路上困扰着她。</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/collins-kavanaugh-vote-roe-v-wade.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[支持堕胎权的参议员苏珊·柯林斯支持布雷特·卡瓦诺的最高法院法官提名。这已成为她竞选连任的一个主要问题。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/collins-kavanaugh-vote-roe-v-wade.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:00:56 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普对北极船舶的执着导致了数十亿美元的无投标合同</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/climate/trump-arctic-ships.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总统在与芬兰总统打完一场高尔夫球后决定购买11艘极地破冰船。专家表示，目前还不清楚美国是否需要这么多。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/climate/trump-arctic-ships.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:00:17 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>有证据表明美国向伊朗住宅区投下炸弹，造成3名平民死亡</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/world/middleeast/us-iran-bomb-mk84-qeshm-island.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[据《泰晤士报》分析，这枚武器是美国武器库中最大的武器之一，击中了人口稠密地区的一所房屋。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/world/middleeast/us-iran-bomb-mk84-qeshm-island.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 03:40:13 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>前奥运选手大卫·赫恩因破坏倒影池而被撤销指控</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/david-hearn-reflecting-pool-vandalism-charges.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在联邦检察官承认特朗普政府关于破坏公物的指控是错误的之后，一名前奥运会选手将不会面临审判。]]></description>
